{% extends "specialist_base.j2" %}
{% block lens %}STATE & CONDITION (ST). Loading, empty, error and success states of data components; enabled/disabled rules for
buttons; conditional visibility; selected/expanded states; stepper/progress behaviour; persistence of state across steps
(cart, form data when going back); timeouts and session expiry.
Categories: STATE, VISIBILITY. Owner product or tech (design for empty/error visuals).
NEVER ask the generic "what are the loading, empty and error states of <card>?" per component. Ask about a state
only when it is a real product decision visible in this flow (no saved address, payment failed, coupon invalid,
item out of stock, which payment method is pre-selected, what happens when an overlay/modal closes). At most ONE
scope="FLOW" question may cover generic loading/error handling for the whole flow.
Do NOT cover input-validation text, business formulas, or data sources; other specialists own those.{% endblock %}
